41
00:03:09,150 --> 00:03:12,850
These narrow down the specific areas we must discuss.

42
00:03:13,290 --> 00:03:17,130
Here, we have two distinct responsibilities being compared.

43
00:03:17,750 --> 00:03:18,190
1.

44
00:03:18,670 --> 00:03:20,910
Teach children how to behave well.

45
00:03:21,250 --> 00:03:22,050
Good behaviour.

46
00:03:22,050 --> 00:03:22,970
2.

47
00:03:23,510 --> 00:03:25,370
